Subject: [PATCH 17/22] test-posix: Check the POSIX wide-string functions and
 wcwidth

wcsnlen against a guard page, wcpcpy, wcpncpy, wcsdup, wcslcpy,
wcslcat, wcscasecmp, wcsncasecmp, their _l forms, wcscoll_l and
wcsxfrm_l; and wcwidth and wcswidth for null, printable and
non-printable characters in the C locale and C.UTF-8.
